# radroots_protocol_contract_v1

This is the README for `radroots_protocol_contract_v1`, which contains the source-owned Protocol Contract V1 descriptors for public Radroots event catalogs and transport capability vocabulary.

## Quarantine status

This package is a retired, `publish = false` compatibility shim. New code must
use `radroots_protocol::capability::v1` and `radroots_protocol::event::v1`.
It remains only for the SDK runtime compatibility package and the separately
versioned CLI consumer discovered during release-v1 migration. Step 270 removes
the final CLI dependency and this package; it must not become a registry
identity or receive new behavior before then.

